WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:02.470
This is Keokuk, Watchful Fox,

2
00:00:02.760 --> 00:00:06.490
a major Sauk leader who negotiated
with the United States for decades.

3
00:00:06.940 --> 00:00:11.890
He chose diplomacy over war,
opposing Black Hawk's resistance in 1832,

4
00:00:12.360 --> 00:00:15.110
and he signed treaties
that gave up Sauk land in Iowa.

5
00:00:15.720 --> 00:00:20.610
Thomas Easterly made this daguerreotype
in 1847, in his St. Louis studio.

6
00:00:21.260 --> 00:00:24.730
It is one of the earliest known photographs
of a Native American leader.

7
00:00:25.280 --> 00:00:27.490
Yet here, that political life disappears.

8
00:00:27.980 --> 00:00:32.230
What you see is regalia:
the roach headdress, the bear-claw necklace.
